1,41.851 511,50 C511,58.147 511.035,59.17 511.181,62.369 C511.326,65.562 511.834,67.743 512.574,69.651 C513.342,71.625 514.368,73.296 516.035,74.965 C517.703,76.634 519.376,77.658 521.349,78.425 C523.257,79.167 525.438,79.673 528.631,79.82 C531.831,79.965 532.853,80.001 541,80.001 C549.148,80.001 550.169,79.965 553.369,79.82 C556.562,79.673 558.743,79.167 560.652,78.425 C562.623,77.658 564.297,76.634 565.965,74.965 C567.633,73.296 568.659,71.625 569.425,69.651 C570.167,67.743 570.674,65.562 570.82,62.369 C570.966,59.17 571,58.147 571,50 C571,41.851 570.966,40.831 570.82,37.631\"></path></g></g></g></svg></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p></a></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//platform.instagram.com/en_US/embeds.js\"></script></p>\n<div class=\"alert alert-error\">鎌倉・材木座の浄土宗大本山 天照山 光明寺で開催される、市民が企画運営を行う生演奏盆踊り祭です。盆踊り・ライブ・ダンスショーなどのステージパフォーマンスや、綿菓子・金魚すくいなど昔ながらの縁日、キッチンカーやマルシェが出店します。</div>\n<div>\n<div id=\"attachment_36844\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-36844\" class=\"size-full wp-image-36844\" src=\"https://kamakura-zushi.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/45/2026/06/IMG_2542.jpeg\" alt=\"やまぼん\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://kamakura-zushi.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/45/2026/06/IMG_2542.jpeg 1280w, https://kamakura-zushi.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/45/2026/06/IMG_2542-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-36844\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※写真はイメージです。</p></div></p>\n<p>生演奏の盆踊り＆ステージパフォーマンスに、のど自慢大会、昔ながらのレトロな縁日 、キッチンカー＆マルシェ などイベント盛りだくさんです。気になる方は足を運んでみてはいかがでしょうか。</p>\n<p>「光明寺」はこちら↓</p>\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyBAbhvZJhVdJVLZvekSyjro2-lJK0LQR4U&zoom=15&q=%E5%85%89%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%BA,+%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%88%E5%B7%9D%E7%9C%8C%E9%8E%8C%E5%80%89%E5%B8%82%E6%9D%90%E6%9C%A8%E5%BA%A7%EF%BC%96%E4%B8%81%E7%9B%AE%EF%BC%91%EF%BC%97%E2%88%92%EF%BC%91%EF%BC%99\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"auto\" height=\"350\"></iframe>\n</div>\n"
